== Phase 4: Styled Code Blocks
=== Simple Code Block
#block(
  fill: rgb("#f6f8fa"),
  stroke: 1pt + rgb("#e1e4e8"),
  inset: 1em,
  radius: 4pt,
  width: 100%,
)[
```rust
fn main() {
    println!("Hello, World!");
}
```
]

=== Code Block with Title
#block(
  fill: rgb("#f6f8fa"),
  stroke: 1pt + rgb("#e1e4e8"),
  inset: 0pt,
  radius: 4pt,
  width: 100%,
)[
  #block(
    fill: rgb("#e1e4e8"),
    inset: (x: 1em, y: 0.5em),
    width: 100%,
    radius: (top: 4pt),
  )[#text(size: 0.9em, fill: rgb("#57606a"))[Example]]
  #block(inset: 1em)[
```python
def greet(name: str) -> str:
    return f"Hello, {name}!"

print(greet("World"))
```
  ]
]

